<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 21:32:58 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>白昼之月</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac17481f1e4d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;白昼之月&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A pale moon in a clear blue sky above green and yellow tree canopies." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ac17481f1e4d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 21:32:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>看房时遇到这只可爱的猫。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac16dc6e773c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;看房时遇到这只可爱的猫。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Cat on staircase " height="1915" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/birming/6ac16dc6e773c.jpg" width="2553"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://birming.some.pics"&gt;@birming&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 21:04:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今天早上外出徒步时，发现这块地衣长在一个老树桩上。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac152fe4dabd</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天早上外出徒步时，发现这块地衣长在一个老树桩上。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up of clusters of layered, wavy shelf fungi growing across the dark, weathered surface of a tree trunk. The mushrooms have dark brown undersides and pale tan, ruffled edges, creating an intricate, overlapping pattern against the rough bark." height="3357" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6ac152fe4dabd.jpg" width="2518"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 19:09:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在奥克马尔吉土丘国家历史公园，沿着步道盛开着明黄色的花朵。今天徒步了5英里，探索了这些小径。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac150b927383</link><d